// Karoryfer Lecolds libraries cajon_kick: cajon played as a kick (unpitched). Samples: Karoryfer Lecolds (Black And Green Guitars, Emily Guitar, Black And Blue Basses, D. Smolken double bass, Aliexpress Erhu, Swirly Drums), CC0 1.0 (https://github.com/sfzinstruments).
// Generated by scripts/make_karoryfer_library.py; sample paths are relative to the library's cache folder.
